<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; background:#f4f6f9; margin:0; padding:0; }
  .wrapper { max-width:600px; margin:32px auto; background:#ffffff; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }
  .header { background:#0070d2; padding:28px 32px; }
  .header h1 { color:#fff; margin:0; font-size:20px; font-weight:600; }
  .header p { color:#cce4ff; margin:4px 0 0; font-size:13px; }
  .body { padding:32px; }
  .body p { color:#333; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 16px; }
  .amount-box { background:#f0f7ff; border-left:4px solid #0070d2; border-radius:4px; padding:16px 20px; margin:20px 0; }
  .amount-box .label { font-size:12px; color:#666; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.6px; }
  .amount-box .value { font-size:28px; font-weight:700; color:#0070d2; margin-top:4px; }
  .detail-row { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:10px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #eee; font-size:14px; }
  .detail-row:last-child { border-bottom:none; }
  .detail-label { color:#666; }
  .detail-value { color:#111; font-weight:500; }
  .footer { background:#f4f6f9; padding:20px 32px; text-align:center; font-size:12px; color:#888; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrapper">
  <div class="header">
    <h1>Rent Due Tomorrow</h1>
    <p>RentIt Property Management</p>
  </div>
  <div class="body">
    <p>Hi there,</p>
    <p>This is a friendly reminder that your rent payment is due <strong>tomorrow</strong>.</p>
    <div class="amount-box">
      <div class="label">Amount Due</div>
      <div class="value">${!Invoice__c.Total_Amount__c}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="detail-row"><span class="detail-label">Invoice Number</span><span class="detail-value">{!Invoice__c.Name}</span></div>
    <div class="detail-row"><span class="detail-label">Due Date</span><span class="detail-value">{!Invoice__c.Due_Date__c}</span></div>
    <div class="detail-row"><span class="detail-label">Period</span><span class="detail-value">{!Invoice__c.Period_Start__c} – {!Invoice__c.Period_End__c}</span></div>
    <p style="margin-top:24px;">Please ensure payment is made by the due date to avoid late fees. Once paid, log into the portal to create a Payment record and submit it for approval.</p>
    <p>If you have already paid, please disregard this message.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
    RentIt Property Management &bull; This is an automated notification. Please do not reply to this email.
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>